 <span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Organizations seeking empanelment must fulfil the following criteria:</span></span></p>
<ul>
 <li>
  <span xss=removed><span xss=removed>A demonstrable commitment to women’s rights specifically works on violence against women (VAW), workplace safety, and empowerment;</span></span></li>
 <li>
  <span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Prior experience in conducting training sessions, workshops, or awareness programs focused on women’s laws, preferably the POSH Act;</span></span></li>
 <li>
  <span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Registration under the <strong>DARPAN Portal</strong> or <strong>NITI Aayog</strong>, in compliance with applicable government norms;</span></span></li>
 <li>
  <span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Documented initiatives aimed at implementing workplace safety measures in accordance with the POSH Act.</span></span></li>
</ul>
<p>
  </p>                    </div>
                                    <button class="accordion"
                            id="accordion-9"
                            aria-controls="panel-9"
